<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pacific Gulf a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pacific Gulf a buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co analyst Jay Leupp started coverage of Pacific Gulf Properties Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- In a statement said the real estate investment trust (REIT) offers &quot;a compelling value&quot; versus its peers.</p>
<p>-- said its shares, at a current price of about 21-1/4, trade at 96 percent of its net asset value and are at a 20 to 26 percent discount &quot;compared to the average equity REIT.&quot;</p>
<p>-- targets the stock at $25.50 over 12 months based on a multiple of 12 times Leupp's 1998 estimate of $2.12 a share.</p>
</text>
